{"name": "Song of Kings", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Song of Kings</i> is a puzzle platformer inspired by Sri Lankan mythology. You play as Yakshira, a  yaksha child who strays too far from his home realm, gets captured and is trapped in a kingdom ruled by a ruthless king. Guided by the soul of his grandfather and armed with a magical flute, he must outwit enemies, solve ancient puzzles, and uncover the mysteries of his heritage. Travel through mystical forests, ruined temples, dungeons, and human settlements, each filled with secrets, dangers, and forgotten stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/fdfd762e7f1c19954561989d3023a7d0.avif?t=1786007277\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The flute is more than an instrument\u2014it is the key to your journey. Hidden melodies lie in the world around you, and each one reveals paths, awakens secrets, and uncovers fragments of the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/4b53a27f9e1af26d7d014fba28b00010.poster.avif?t=1786007277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/4b53a27f9e1af26d7d014fba28b00010.webm?t=1786007277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/4b53a27f9e1af26d7d014fba28b00010.mp4?t=1786007277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/ed532cc8fb9507047c6c13e0c958e30d.avif?t=1786007277\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Stay alert. Guards and creatures will stand in your way, each reacting to your presence and the sounds you create. Observe your surroundings, use the environment to your advantage, and find a way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/059ea4fa39749fbd3e6f5717178ce4c6.poster.avif?t=1786007277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/059ea4fa39749fbd3e6f5717178ce4c6.webm?t=1786007277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/059ea4fa39749fbd3e6f5717178ce4c6.mp4?t=1786007277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"96\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/556c88da81b9355c7c9f693b3b56c0c5.avif?t=1786007277\" width=\"1170\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">From vibrant Yaksha villages to dark dungeons and ancient jungle temples, explore a world steeped in folklore and mystery. Keep your journal close\u2014it records the discoveries, places, and stories you uncover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"494\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/5b92481ddcc5d2f0e79e77bb1b6613d1.poster.avif?t=1786007277\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/5b92481ddcc5d2f0e79e77bb1b6613d1.webm?t=1786007277\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/extras/5b92481ddcc5d2f0e79e77bb1b6613d1.mp4?t=1786007277\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Can you guide Yakshira back to his homeland, or will the kingdom\u2019s darkness consume him?<br/>The <i>Song of Kings</i> has begun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Song of Kings is a narrative platformer inspired by Sri Lankan myth. A Yaksha boy, captured by humans, must escape a ruthless king. Guided by his grandfather\u2019s spirit and armed with a magical flute, he uncovers his heritage and fights to return to his people.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3985280/64115eab603b1b025effe3256a286558295d25de/header.jpg?t=1786007277", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Stealth", "Controller", "Linear", "Adventure", "Strategy", "Mythology"], "developers": "Mogo Games", "publishers": "Mogo Games", "release_date": "2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3985280", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "6 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/Ij4E_eMwFzU", "first_seen": 1785967200.0, "review_rank": 181}